                                                "sense_id": "47f51dd0-a2ac-3fc6-b837-675ee16e9129",
                                                "text": "[…]when indeed they have ſeen nothing, but have ſtole the word of the Lord from others, and borrowed from their neighbour[…]"
                                            },
